Next, install NGINX and configure it to be a reverse proxy to Gunicorn.

sudo apt install nginx

Create a configuration file at /etc/nginx/conf.d/cape. You might need to add include /etc/nginx/conf.d/*.conf; to http section inside of /etc/nginx/nginx.conf.

Replace www.capesandbox.com with your actual hostname.

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name www.capesandbox.com;
    client_max_body_size 101M;
    proxy_connect_timeout 75;
    proxy_send_timeout 200;
    proxy_read_timeout 200;


    location ^~ /.well-known/acme-challenge/ {
        default_type "text/plain";
        root         /var/www/html;
        break;
    }

    location = /.well-known/acme-challenge/ {
        return 404;
